        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM3301, 48\" MegaTek Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe MegaTek straight door pulls with flat ends showcases effortless style in a simple design.  Clean and contemporary, this 60\" ladder style door pull handle made of 304 stainless steel is available with either a satin or polished finish.  It is also available in 316 Marine Grade stainless steel that offers superior corrosion resistance in harsh environments.  The MegaTek collection of pulls offers a pleasing, functional, modern solution to any entry door. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ROC-RM3301-48_size.gif?v=1774586591\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"6 Foot Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 48\" contemporary ladder style handles feature a easy to grip 1-1/4\" round pull handle that is very comfortable to the hand. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for ROC-RM3301 Stainless Steel Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\" (4 feet)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 or 316 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Satin or Polished Stainless Steel </li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thru-Bolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "48 Inch MegaTek Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "These 48 Inch MegaTek ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4  round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors.  Clean, Contemporary, Solid. For use on residential and commercial doors. Warm Satin Stainless Steel or Bright Polished Stainless Steel finish requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
                "keywords": "ROC-RM3301, 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Stainless MegaTek Pulls, Rockwood RM3301, 1-1/4 Diameter Stainless MegaTek Door Pulls, contemporary Large Door Pulls, contemporary door pulls, Rockwood RM3301 1-1/4 Diameter Stainless Steel Pulls, 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Modern Stainless Steel Door Pulls, ROC-RM3301-630, Rockwood ROC-RM3301-629"
